# Cloudflare Pages - Routing Configuration
#
# No rules are needed:
#   - Without a 404.html, Pages serves index.html for unknown paths (SPA mode).
#   - privacy.html is served at /privacy by Pages' built-in clean URLs, and /privacy.html
#     redirects to /privacy. A "/privacy /privacy.html 200" rewrite makes those two
#     redirect to each other forever (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS).
#   - Rules without a destination (e.g. "/*.pdf 200") are invalid, and "/* /index.html 200"
#     is flagged as an infinite loop; Pages ignores all of them.
